'''Aioi''' (相生) is a small port city in western [[Hyogo]].

==Understand==
===Tourist information site===
The local tourist association has a [https://aioi.in/ Japanese-only guide site]. [https://aioi.in/pamphlet-2/ Its Pamphlet section] has a guide map in English.

==Get in==
{{Mapframe|zoom=auto}}
{{mapshape}}

Aioi Station is served by the Sanyo Shinkansen. The JR Sanyo Main Line and the Ako Line also run through Aioi.

